        "flags": [],
        "move_id": "",
        "description": "Auto-generated from selected effects:\n\n- Item Expert Belt:\nSlightly boosts super-effective moves by 20%.It must be carried by a Pokémon.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Super-effective moves deal 1.2x damage.\n- Fling base power: 10.\n\n- Item Black Belt:\nIt must be carried by a Pokémon.Increases decisiveness and strengthens Fighting type attacks.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Fling base power: 30.\n\n- Item Big Root:\nBoosts moves that steal HP.It must be carried by a Pokémon.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Drain/healing-from-damage effects are multiplied by 1.3x.\n- Fling base power: 10.\n\n- Move Draining Kiss:\nFairy-type special move. Target: Nearother.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Base power: 60.\n- Accuracy: 100%.\n- Base PP: 10.\n- Recovers HP equal to 3/4 of damage dealt.\n- Internal function code: HealUserByThreeQuartersOfDamageDone.\n\n- Move Hone Claws:\nThe user sharpens their claws to increase their Attack and Accuracy.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Accuracy: no standard accuracy roll (self-target or guaranteed effect).\n- Base PP: 15.\n- Raises Attack and Accuracy of user by 1 stage.\n- Internal function code: RaiseUserAtkAcc1.\n\n- Move Amnesia:\nThe user forgets its worries and increases Special Defense a lot.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Accuracy: no standard accuracy roll (self-target or guaranteed effect).\n- Base PP: 20.\n- Raises Sp. Def of user by 2 stages.\n- Internal function code: RaiseUserSpDef2.\n\n- Move Bulk Up:\nStrengthens the body to increase Attack and Defense.\n\nMechanics (Known):\n- Accuracy: no standard accuracy roll (self-target or guaranteed effect).\n- Base PP: 20.\n- Raises Attack and Defense of user by 1 stage.\n- Internal function code: RaiseUserAtkDef1.\n\n- Ability Unseen Fist:\nIf you use a contact move, you can deal damage to the target even if they are shielding.\n\n- Ability Scrappy:\nNormal or Fighting-type moves hit Ghost-type Pokémon.He is also immune to Intimidation.\n\n- Ability Shed Skin:\nThe Pokémon has a 30% chance to cure its status ailments at the end of each turn by shedding its skin.",
        "consumable": false,
        "show_quantity": true
      },
